DP7plYjZAt5z1u628tQtrxn5UG2Q3SSQOEkJtGEZznquo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0_Uaw3gZ5cSJiFDg2JxvHedstTiKiyMmCl4zZbxP2H0g&oe=69DE4467"}, {"file_name": "peek.png", "id": "1009464856621649", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210389_1009464859954982_7090744758627338677_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=shUIpyq6ZmcQ7kNvwFeW1Ld&_nc_oc=AdqNj6ALh99WxYLL9D9m9_3F73iJb1MnGvYAJ4ZWU6MLkOzHaIiCXA8UeKhGSnvbkO0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3o1EoCyrlgVpM5OLPdedk6B1Giq5vIuhdBjWia50xkug&oe=69DE28DC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "banner.png", "id": "636604377435150", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003244_636604380768483_6976895474501699949_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pDOx00cEJhQQ7kNvwFa_NMq&_nc_oc=Ado6k9kl2_y64HJw_Lzb8Aa4qjlFcKg4TphAg1voF4zksMdUw5ABjI4p-nU65C7OWf8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af22M0sMSIf2yDMdSxFKUSQAIGhhYGBcx7-yokuBtIBK8A&oe=69DE23B6"}, "display_name": "Puppet VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Puppet VR is like a virtual puppet theater. Pick a bunny, make a recording, repeat. Improvise a funny scene, or have conversations with yourself!\n\n**Features**\n- 4 space bunnies, controlled by YOU\n- Record your voice, movement, or both\n- Play back your recordings - all 4 at the same time\n- Play in Quest Standalone - no wires needed\n\n**Your creativity's the limit!**\n- Create funny scenes, with yourself from the past\n- Go a capella, and make the bunnies sing\n- Host a bunny dance party\n- ... And more!\n\nPuppet VR is currently in development", "short_description": "A virtual puppet theater where every actor is YOU!\n\nControl up to 4 bunnies at the same time, and use them to make a movie, sing a song or host a dance party - your creativity is the limit!"}]}, "developer_name": "Daniel Tauritis", "developer_privacy_policy_url